OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSome brightness possible
OL,6,Ffirst thing, but soon becoming cloudy
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of rain, some of which
OL,8,Fare likely to be heavy at times.
OL,9,FBecoming windy into the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FLargely dry with sunny spells and
OL,13,Flight winds Thursday. Heavy and
OL,14,Fpersistent rain, accompanied by strong
OL,15,Fwinds Friday. Sunny spells and a few
OL,16,Fshowers Saturday, but rain arriving
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
